<title>POLAND: Amerbank to move to main mkt on Feb 21.</title>
<headline>Amerbank to move to main mkt on Feb 21.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish bank Amerbank SA will move its shares to the main market from the parallel market of the Warsaw bourse on February 21, the president of the bourse said on Friday.</p>
<p>&quot;From February 21 Amerbank's shares will be listed on the main market,&quot; Wieslaw Rozlucki told reporters after the bourse session.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
